# S2a (plan.md step 6): the new base on hardware, before the fabric re-measure. Runs WHILE the thin layer builds.
#  1. reset:  all four boards together plus the heal. This is the LAST reset before the placement: the fabric
#             re-measure (tt-measure-links.yml, step 8) runs AFTER this job and nothing may reset the cards after it.
#  2. probe:  the prefix-reuse P0a probe inside the image (CPU only, no device). Optional: drop it from C2_ACTIONS when
#             the quad-replay commit is already done and time is short; the hardware prefix gate below supersedes it
#             for G1.
#  3. prefix: J4's bringup plan on the NEW base (grants disabled == the no-reuse baseline byte for byte, the first hit
#             compiles nothing, the install and platform lines). J4 qualified the tp4/bringup image tp4-1; this base is
#             main, so re-prove it (J4 took 6 min).
# The status step's "=== agent" journal is the token-free evidence that no placement exists (no load attempts).
# C1 as in S1. Duration: status 1-2 min, reset 3-12 min, probe 15-40 min, prefix 6-15 min.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=status reset probe prefix
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-g1-C1
C2_PROFILE=general-prefix-tp4
C2_PREFIX_PLAN=bringup
C2_PREFIX_PROFILE=general-prefix-tp4
C2_PREFIX_BASELINE=general-tp4
